# Sprint Execution: PDDA-SPRINT-1

> **Sprint ID:** PDDA-SPRINT-1
> **Generated:** 2026-04-01
> **Source:** `02_compressed_PDDA-SPRINT-1.md`
> **Target:** Architecture Health 7/10 → 9/10
> **Estimated Duration:** 45 hours

---

## Pre-Sprint: Baseline & Lessons

### Lessons Applied (Pre-Work)
| Lesson | Source | Constraint Applied |
|--------|--------|-------------------|
| GROQ schema verification | `failures/groq-schema-assumption.md` | Verify field types before `->` syntax |
| Brand is string NOT ref | `failures/groq-reference-syntax.md` | Migration required before queries |
| Signal density optimization | `prompting/signal-density-optimization.md` | Compressed context fed to Opus |
| Sequencing enforcement | `auto-lessons.md:472-527` | Pass 1→2→3, Layer 1→2→3→4 mandatory |
| Data verification | `failures/debug-data-assumption.md` | Verify data before code changes |
| Baseline check | `workflows/pre-flight-baseline-check.md` | Pre-sprint build gate required |
| Parallel fetching | `patterns/parallel-data-fetching.md` | `Promise.all` for independent fetches |
| VFS architecture | `patterns/vfs-catalog-architecture.md` | O(1) lookups, no recursive queries |

### Scope Lock Rules
- **NO** `globals.css` modifications
- **NO** homepage changes
- **NO** data structure changes outside Brand scope
- **NO** client-side state management changes
- **NO** arbitrary schema field additions
- **NO** Suspense boundary changes outside product discovery

### Pre-Sprint Regression Containment

| Code Area | Risk Level | Regression Test | Location |
|-----------|------------|-------------------|----------|
| `getProductsByVfsKeys.ts` | **CRITICAL** | Query returns products | `tests/catalogue/vfs-query.test.ts` |
| `FilterConfigProvider.tsx` | **HIGH** | Filters render without error | `tests/component/FilterConfigProvider.spec.tsx` |
| `CategoryPageClient.tsx` | **HIGH** | Sort dropdown functions | `tests/component/CategoryPageClient.spec.tsx` |
| `productType.ts schema` | **CRITICAL** | Existing products valid | `tests/catalogue/schema-validation.test.ts` |
| `sanity.types.ts` | **HIGH** | Type generation succeeds | `npm run typegen` |
| `FilterSidebar.tsx` | **MEDIUM** | Filter options display | `tests/component/FilterSidebar.spec.tsx` |
| `ProductGrid.tsx` | **MEDIUM** | Product grid renders | `tests/component/ProductGrid.spec.tsx` |

### Baseline Commands
```bash
npm run build
npx vitest run tests/catalogue/
npx vitest run tests/component/
```

