## Sprint Lock Conditions

**Sprint is COMPLETE when:**
1. ✅ All 8 scope contracts show 100% DoD test pass rate
2. ✅ All regression tests pass (9/9)
3. ✅ `npm run build` succeeds
4. ✅ `npm run typegen` succeeds
5. ✅ `npx tsc --noEmit` passes
6. ✅ Final evidence dashboard populated

**Sprint is BLOCKED when:**
- Any scope contract shows <100% pass rate
- Regression tests fail
- Build gate fails
- Dependencies not satisfied (execution order violated)

